{"synopsis":"Era penaklukan Dungeon telah tiba\nTujuh Malevolent Dungeon adalah Dungeon yang dianggap mustahil untuk ditaklukan\nDi dalam dungeon yang paling disegani Primordial Core hiduplah Swallow yang terkuat di antara mereka semua\nBagaimana bisa seseorang yang seharusnya menjadi seorang monster bos tertidur sampai manusia berada di hadapanmu\nKarena kunjungan yang tiada akhir dari manusia pintu masuk Primordial Core tidak akan pernah kosong\nTapi bukannya itu berarti mereka tidak akan pernah berhenti mengganggu Swallow\nAaku tidak mau melakukan itu Ini adalah perjungan dari seorang Monster Bos yang hanya ingin bersantai","alternative_title":"Mr Devourer, Please Act Like a Final Boss, 보스 몹답게 행동하세요, 스왈로우 씨!","author":"Reltree","artist":"Wookjakga","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"0532e38b-ad27-4469-91d9-996cbaedeabb","number":"136","chapter":"136","title":"Chapter 136","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"9a86dac9-eb79-4d65-8a71-b26803e5377c","number":"135","chapter":"135","title":"Chapter 135","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1d2120a3-5b6f-4ac3-b19b-2f3224146d1c","number":"134","chapter":"134","title":"Chapter 134","date":"2026-07-15","released":"2026-07-15","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"dedb2d72-c539-4679-a4ca-76c23dd02a2f","number":"133","chapter":"133","title":"Chapter 133","date":"2026-07-07","released":"2026-07-07","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"12c1e86a-3f19-450b-975f-ed384d3f9a77","number":"132","chapter":"132","title":"Chapter 132","date":"2026-06-30","released":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"4e8b61ab-2668-4b5e-825b-7535dbe1696c","number":"131","chapter":"131","title":"Chapter 131","date":"2026-06-23","released":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b0f519ea-6545-4584-90b5-acafccde9320","number":"130","chapter":"130","title":"Chapter 130","date":"2026-06-17","released":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a8903221-c400-429d-bfeb-33dd7195a36b","number":"129","chapter":"129","